---
// Minimal one-page Astro source for the real-bundler falsification probe -- see
// astro-real-bundler-conformance.test.ts for what this is checked against and why. Deliberately plain:
// one heading, one scoped <style> block (so `astro build` actually emits a CSS bundle to test asset-path
// rewriting against), no islands/client directives -- Astro has no built-in equivalent to Tovu's
// `data-tovu-island` marker, so island-content coverage is out of scope for this minimal probe.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Astro Bundler Probe</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Astro bundler probe</h1>
    <p>One real page, built by a real bundler, checked against Tovu's static theme contract.</p>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  h1 {
    color: rebeccapurple;
  }
</style>
